/-!
# Transport of Homotopy-Limit Presentations

This module collects transport of explicit homotopy-limit presentations along
isomorphisms of their first objects and inverse systems, together with the compatible
presentation isomorphisms induced by both constructions.
It also exports the standard isomorphism-closed object-property instances for both
arguments of `HomotopyLimit.IsOf`.
-/
